Short:        Update Minix 1.5.10 to 1.5.10.2
Author:       Steven Reiz
Uploader:     aminet aminet net
Type:         misc/os
Version:      1.5.10.2
Architecture: other

This archive contains two update patches (including sources) for Amiga
Minix 1.5.10 (see misc/os/Minix_Amiga.tgz). Thanks a lot to Thomas Unger
for providing them. These patches were supplied by Steven Reiz and
represent the latest version of Amiga Minix.

With these patches, Minix supports 68030 CPUs and harddrives.

For more Information about Amiga Minix or Minix in general, visit Thomas
Unger's excellent Amiga Minix site:

http://home.arcor.de/kickstart/TKA/Tutorials/AmigaMINIX/aminix.html
